# api-exam-questions

Question stem, options, correct answer, explanation, and subject are one language. Do not add a second column.

```text
stem, explanation, subject, option.text
```

Those names stay untranslated. A question is one row shared by every paper that attaches it. Detach removes the link only.

An MCQ question has exactly one correct option. An MCQ component accepts MCQ questions. A written component accepts written questions. A mismatch returns `QUESTION_TYPE_MISMATCH`.

Question order on a component is explicit. A later attempt freezes that order. Do not shuffle it.

This stage's component row is a shell: type only. Do not add rules text, a window, a duration, or a deadline here.
